{"chars": "It was the very end of winter. At the North Pole, winter is a long, long night: from autumn until spring, the sun never rises at all, and the only light in the sky comes from the moon, the stars and the dancing northern lights. Now that long night was almost over. In just a few weeks, the sun would peek over the edge of the world for the first time in six months. Last Christmas was over, and next Christmas was far, far away.", "start": [0.225, 0.225, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.338, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 1.188, 1.188, 1.188, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 1.3, 2.1, 2.225, 2.225, 2.225, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.725, 2.725, 2.725, 2.725, 2.725, 3.1, 3.175, 3.175, 3.175, 3.175, 3.175, 3.175, 3.175, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.65, 3.65, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 3.75, 4.075, 4.125, 4.125, 4.125, 4.125, 4.125, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.95, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.025, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.225, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.862, 5.862, 5.862, 5.862, 5.862, 5.862, 5.862, 6.425, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.638, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.15, 7.6, 7.6, 7.6, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 8.25, 8.325, 8.325, 8.325, 8.325, 8.438, 8.438, 8.438, 8.438, 8.55, 8.55, 8.55, 8.55, 8.55, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 9.088, 9.088, 9.088, 9.162, 9.162, 9.162, 9.162, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 10.012, 10.012, 10.012, 10.012, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.675, 10.775, 10.775, 10.775, 10.775, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 11.45, 11.45, 11.45, 11.45, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 11.65, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.213, 12.625, 12.625, 12.625, 12.625, 12.625, 12.625, 12.625, 13.375, 13.488, 13.488, 13.488, 13.488, 13.725, 